      "AgACAgIAAyEFAAMBClOLWAACBQ9q14SVW9hoLOfpadhI_OHUHsTWHQACrCFrG3XYqUoMRa59wF9h_gEAAwIAA3kAAz0E"
    ],
    "caption": "🤖 Claude’s Engineer Raises the Bar\n\nFelix Rieseberg, an Anthropic engineering lead, says Claude can work toward an end goal, not just handle one isolated action. His guide shows how to use that capability more effectively.\n\nRaise the bar on speed, task level, depth, and breadth: ask Claude to stop an app from crashing, investigate failures, and validate the fix. For research, provide source data, database access, and statistical tools to test hypotheses.\n\nSet deliberately difficult goals and check outputs with independent tools instead of trusting self-assessment. That requires computer and source-data integrations beyond chat. The constraint is the scale of work people will delegate.\n\n📊@tech",
